The figure&#x27;s impassive expression, framed by a headdress of curious objects, hints at a deeper psychological depth, suggesting the exploration of the human mind and the realm of dreams. The juxtaposition of the urban landscape in the background with the surreal imagery above creates a striking contrast, underscoring the movement&#x27;s desire to liberate art from the constraints of the visible world.

